# 宏定义和代码生成规范

## 宏设计原则

### 命名规范
- 宏名使用 `snake_case`: `peri_trait`, `pin_trait_impl`
- 生成的类型使用 `PascalCase`: `Instance`, `SealedInstance`
- 参数使用描述性名称: `$instance`, `$signal`, `$trait`

### 文档生成
- 使用 `concat!` 和 `stringify!` 动态生成文档
- 为生成的trait提供描述性文档
- 示例代码使用 `ignore` 标记

```rust
macro_rules! pin_trait {
    ($signal:ident, $instance:path $(, $mode:path)?) => {
        #[doc = concat!(stringify!($signal), " pin trait")]
        pub trait $signal<T: $instance $(, M: $mode)?>: crate::gpio::Pin {
            #[doc = concat!("Get the ALT number needed to use this pin as ", stringify!($signal))]
            fn alt_num(&self) -> u8;
        }
    };
}
```

## 外设Trait宏模式

### 基本外设Trait
```rust
macro_rules! peri_trait {
    (
        $(irqs: [$($irq:ident),*],)?
    ) => {
        #[allow(private_interfaces)]
        pub(crate) trait SealedInstance {
            fn info() -> &'static Info;
            fn state() -> &'static State;
        }

        /// Peripheral instance trait.
        #[allow(private_bounds)]
        pub trait Instance: crate::Peripheral<P = Self> + SealedInstance + crate::sysctl::ClockPeripheral {
            $($(
                /// Interrupt for this peripheral.
                type $irq: crate::interrupt::typelevel::Interrupt;
            )*)?
        }
    };
}
```

### 无系统时钟的外设Trait
```rust
macro_rules! peri_trait_without_sysclk {
    (
        $(irqs: [$($irq:ident),*],)?
    ) => {
        // 类似peri_trait但不包含ClockPeripheral约束
        pub trait Instance: crate::Peripheral<P = Self> + SealedInstance {
            // 中断类型定义
        }
    };
}
```

### 外设实现宏
```rust
macro_rules! peri_trait_impl {
    ($instance:ident, $info:expr) => {
        impl SealedInstance for crate::peripherals::$instance {
            fn info() -> &'static Info {
                static INFO: Info = $info;
                &INFO
            }
            fn state() -> &'static State {
                static STATE: State = State::new();
                &STATE
            }
        }
        impl Instance for crate::peripherals::$instance {}
    };
}
```

## 引脚映射宏模式

### 引脚Trait定义
```rust
macro_rules! pin_trait {
    ($signal:ident, $instance:path $(, $mode:path)?) => {
        pub trait $signal<T: $instance $(, M: $mode)?>: crate::gpio::Pin {
            fn alt_num(&self) -> u8;
        }
    };
}
```

### 引脚实现宏
```rust
macro_rules! pin_trait_impl {
    (crate::$mod:ident::$trait:ident$(<$mode:ident>)?, $instance:ident, $pin:ident, $alt:expr) => {
        impl crate::$mod::$trait<crate::peripherals::$instance $(, crate::$mod::$mode)?> 
            for crate::peripherals::$pin 
        {
            fn alt_num(&self) -> u8 {
                $alt
            }
        }
    };
}
```

## 中断绑定宏

### bind_interrupts宏
```rust
#[macro_export]
macro_rules! bind_interrupts {
    ($vis:vis struct $name:ident { $($irq:ident => $($handler:ty),*;)* }) => {
        #[derive(Copy, Clone)]
        $vis struct $name;

        $(
            #[$crate::interrupt]
            fn $irq() {
                use $crate::interrupt::InterruptExt;
                
                $(
                    <$handler as $crate::interrupt::typelevel::Handler<$crate::interrupt::typelevel::$irq>>::on_interrupt();
                )*
                
                // 通知PLIC中断已处理
                $crate::interrupt::$irq.complete();
            }

            $(
                unsafe impl $crate::interrupt::typelevel::Binding<$crate::interrupt::typelevel::$irq, $handler> for $name {}
            )*
        )*
    };
}
```

## 代码生成脚本规范 (build.rs)

### 基本结构
```rust
use std::collections::{BTreeMap, HashMap, HashSet};
use std::fmt::Write as _;
use std::io::Write as _;
use std::path::{Path, PathBuf};

use hpm_metapac::metadata::METADATA;
use proc_macro2::TokenStream;
use quote::{format_ident, quote};
```

### 芯片特性处理
```rust
fn get_ip_features(chip_family: &str) -> &[&str] {
    match chip_family {
        "hpm67" => &[
            "ADC16_HAS_TEMPSNS",
            "DUAL_CORE",
        ],
        "hpm53" => &[
            "GPTMR_MONITOR",
            "UART_RX_IDLE_DETECT",
            "SPI_NEW_TRANS_COUNT",
        ],
        _ => &[],
    }
}
```

### 代码生成模式
```rust
fn generate_peripheral_code() -> TokenStream {
    let mut tokens = TokenStream::new();
    
    for peripheral in &METADATA.peripherals {
        let name = format_ident!("{}", peripheral.name);
        let instance_type = format_ident!("{}Instance", peripheral.typ);
        
        tokens.extend(quote! {
            impl #instance_type for peripherals::#name {
                // 生成实现
            }
        });
    }
    
    tokens
}
```

### 文件写入
```rust
fn main() {
    let out_dir = env::var_os("OUT_DIR").unwrap();
    let out_dir = Path::new(&out_dir);
    
    // 生成代码
    let generated_code = generate_peripheral_code();
    
    // 写入文件
    let mut file = std::fs::File::create(out_dir.join("_generated.rs")).unwrap();
    write!(file, "{}", generated_code).unwrap();
    
    // 通知cargo重新构建条件
    println!("cargo:rerun-if-changed=build.rs");
    println!("cargo:rerun-if-changed=Cargo.toml");
}
```

## 条件编译宏

### 特性检查宏
```rust
macro_rules! cfg_if_feature {
    ($feature:literal, $($item:item)*) => {
        $(
            #[cfg(feature = $feature)]
            $item
        )*
    };
}
```

### 芯片特性宏
```rust
macro_rules! chip_specific {
    (
        $(
            $chip:ident => {
                $($item:item)*
            }
        )*
    ) => {
        $(
            $(
                #[cfg($chip)]
                $item
            )*
        )*
    };
}
```

